            "value" : "面板會列出你的工作流程和 App。↩ 執行或打開，⌘1–⌘0 選擇對應列，⌘↩ 在此編輯工作流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shortcut works only while the Workflow panel is open. ⌘1–⌘0 always run the row with that number." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
